# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of the host platform's git
# config. Without this, GitHub's windows-latest runners (core.autocrlf=true
# by default) check text files out with CRLF, while every generated file in
# this repo (contracts.ts, sanitized fixtures) is produced with LF — an
# exact-string drift check then reports a false mismatch on line endings
# alone. Confirmed via a real CI failure on this workflow, not speculative.
* text=auto eol=lf
